  "description": "EventLogHelper is a lightweight, strongly-named library that simplifies writing to the Windows Event Log. It provides a static, testable interface for logging messages with automatic handling of event sources, message truncation, and category/event ID assignment. Ideal for developers who need a minimal-dependency logging utility that works seamlessly in Windows environments across .NET Framework and .NET Core/5+/6+/8+ projects.",
